%%report pursuit-gate-age-bands title: How recently pursuit gates were changed entity: PursuitGate chart: bar x: last_changed y: records help: Formal gated review supporting bid and no-bid governance. Records by time since their last change; the oldest band is the stale tail to review or retire. sql: SELECT CASE WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '30 days' THEN 'last 30 days' WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '90 days' THEN '30 to 90 days' WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '180 days' THEN '90 to 180 days' ELSE 'older than 180 days' END AS last_changed, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_pursuit_gate WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY MIN(updated_at) DESC
%%report pursuit-gate-decision-date-per-month title: Pursuit Gates by decision date entity: PursuitGate chart: line x: month y: records help: Formal gated review supporting bid and no-bid governance. Pursuit Gates grouped by the month of decision date, looking two years back and one ahead. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', decision_date), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_pursuit_gate WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND decision_date IS NOT NULL AND decision_date >= now() - interval '24 months' AND decision_date < now() + interval '12 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report pursuit-gate-score-by-status title: Total score by status entity: PursuitGate chart: bar x: status y: total_score help: Formal gated review supporting bid and no-bid governance. Pursuit Gates added up on score, split by status, to show where the quantity sits. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, ROUND(SUM(score)::numeric, 2) AS total_score FROM bus_pursuit_gate WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST
%%report pursuit-gate-score-per-month title: Average score per month entity: PursuitGate chart: line x: month y: average_score help: Formal gated review supporting bid and no-bid governance. The average score of pursuit gates created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(score)::numeric, 2) AS average_score FROM bus_pursuit_gate WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report pursuit-gate-largest-by-score title: The ten largest pursuit gates by score entity: PursuitGate chart: bar x: record y: score help: Formal gated review supporting bid and no-bid governance. The records with the highest score; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT gate_type::text AS record, score FROM bus_pursuit_gate WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND score IS NOT NULL ORDER BY score DESC LIMIT 10
%%report pursuit-gate-per-opportunity title: Pursuit Gates per opportunity entity: PursuitGate chart: bar x: opportunity y: records help: Formal gated review supporting bid and no-bid governance. Which opportunity the most pursuit gates belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS opportunity, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_pursuit_gate x LEFT JOIN bus_opportunity p ON p.id = x.opportunity_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
%%report pursuit-gate-score-per-opportunity title: Total score per opportunity entity: PursuitGate chart: bar x: opportunity y: total_score help: Formal gated review supporting bid and no-bid governance. Pursuit Gates added up on score for each opportunity, ten largest first. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS opportunity, ROUND(SUM(x.score)::numeric, 2) AS total_score FROM bus_pursuit_gate x LEFT JOIN bus_opportunity p ON p.id = x.opportunity_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST LIMIT 10
%%report pursuit-gate-completeness title: How complete pursuit gates are entity: PursuitGate chart: bar x: field y: missing help: Formal gated review supporting bid and no-bid governance. For each optional field, how many pursuit gates leave it empty; the long bars are the fields nobody fills in. sql: SELECT 'score' AS field, COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE score IS NULL) AS missing FROM bus_pursuit_gate WHERE deleted_at IS NULL UNION ALL SELECT 'decision', COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE decision IS NULL) FROM bus_pursuit_gate WHERE deleted_at IS NULL UNION ALL SELECT 'decision date', COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE decision_date IS NULL) FROM bus_pursuit_gate WHERE deleted_at IS NULL UNION ALL SELECT 'approver', COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE approver_id IS NULL) FROM bus_pursuit_gate WHERE deleted_at IS NULL UNION ALL SELECT 'rationale', COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE rationale IS NULL) FROM bus_pursuit_gate WHERE deleted_at IS NULL ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report competitor-by-capabilities title: Competitors by capabilities entity: Competitor chart: pie x: capabilities y: records help: Competitor master and capability profile. How competitors divide across capabilities, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(capabilities::text, '(unset)') AS capabilities, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_competitor WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report competitor-by-regions title: Competitors by regions entity: Competitor chart: pie x: regions y: records help: Competitor master and capability profile. How competitors divide across regions, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(regions::text, '(unset)') AS regions, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_competitor WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
