%%report bid-package-by-status title: Bid Packages by status entity: BidPackage chart: pie x: status y: records help: Trade or scope package released to bidders. How bid packages divide across status, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_bid_package WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report bid-package-lifecycle title: Bid Package lifecycle entity: BidPackage chart: bar x: state y: records help: Trade or scope package released to bidders. Where bid packages sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'draft' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'active', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'cancelled', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'closed', 3) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_bid_package WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
%%report bid-package-per-bid title: Bid Packages per bid entity: BidPackage chart: bar x: bid y: records help: Trade or scope package released to bidders. Which bid the most bid packages belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.status::text, '(none)') AS bid, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_bid_package x LEFT JOIN bus_bid p ON p.id = x.bid_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
%%report invitation-to-bid-by-compliance-status title: Invitation To Bids by compliance status entity: InvitationToBid chart: pie x: compliance_status y: records help: Invitation and response from a subcontractor or supplier. How invitation to bids divide across compliance status, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(compliance_status::text, '(unset)') AS compliance_status, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_invitation_to_bid WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report invitation-to-bid-by-response title: Invitation To Bids by response entity: InvitationToBid chart: pie x: response y: records help: Invitation and response from a subcontractor or supplier. How invitation to bids divide across response, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(response::text, '(unset)') AS response, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_invitation_to_bid WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report invitation-to-bid-quoted-amount-by-compliance-status title: Total quoted amount by compliance status entity: InvitationToBid chart: bar x: compliance_status y: total_quoted_amount help: Invitation and response from a subcontractor or supplier. Invitation To Bids added up on quoted amount, split by compliance status, to show where the quantity sits. sql: SELECT COALESCE(compliance_status::text, '(unset)') AS compliance_status, ROUND(SUM(quoted_amount)::numeric, 2) AS total_quoted_amount FROM bus_invitation_to_bid WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST
%%report invitation-to-bid-quoted-amount-per-month title: Average quoted amount per month entity: InvitationToBid chart: line x: month y: average_quoted_amount help: Invitation and response from a subcontractor or supplier. The average quoted amount of invitation to bids created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(quoted_amount)::numeric, 2) AS average_quoted_amount FROM bus_invitation_to_bid WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report invitation-to-bid-largest-by-quoted-amount title: The ten largest invitation to bids by quoted amount entity: InvitationToBid chart: bar x: record y: quoted_amount help: Invitation and response from a subcontractor or supplier. The records with the highest quoted amount; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT compliance_status::text AS record, quoted_amount FROM bus_invitation_to_bid WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND quoted_amount IS NOT NULL ORDER BY quoted_amount DESC LIMIT 10
