%%report trade-by-default-risk-class title: Trades by default risk class entity: Trade chart: pie x: default_risk_class y: records help: Controlled construction trade taxonomy. How trades divide across default risk class, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(default_risk_class::text, '(unset)') AS default_risk_class, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_trade WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report trade-created-per-month title: Trades created per month entity: Trade chart: line x: month y: records help: Controlled construction trade taxonomy. New trades per month over two years - the volume the business actually handles. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_trade WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report trade-per-parent-trade title: Trades per parent trade entity: Trade chart: bar x: parent_trade y: records help: Controlled construction trade taxonomy. Which parent trade the most trades belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS parent_trade, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_trade x LEFT JOIN bus_parent_trade p ON p.id = x.parent_trade_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
%%report supplier-performance-quality-score-per-month title: Average quality score per month entity: SupplierPerformance chart: line x: month y: average_quality_score help: Periodic supplier or subcontractor scorecard. The average quality score of supplier performances created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(quality_score)::numeric, 2) AS average_quality_score FROM bus_supplier_performance WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report supplier-performance-safety-score-per-month title: Average safety score per month (Supplier Performance) entity: SupplierPerformance chart: line x: month y: average_safety_score help: Periodic supplier or subcontractor scorecard. The average safety score of supplier performances created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(safety_score)::numeric, 2) AS average_safety_score FROM bus_supplier_performance WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report supplier-performance-schedule-score-per-month title: Average schedule score per month entity: SupplierPerformance chart: line x: month y: average_schedule_score help: Periodic supplier or subcontractor scorecard. The average schedule score of supplier performances created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(schedule_score)::numeric, 2) AS average_schedule_score FROM bus_supplier_performance WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report supplier-performance-per-project title: Supplier Performances per project entity: SupplierPerformance chart: bar x: project y: records help: Periodic supplier or subcontractor scorecard. Which project the most supplier performances belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS project, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_supplier_performance x LEFT JOIN bus_project p ON p.id = x.project_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
%%report supplier-performance-quality-score-per-project title: Total quality score per project entity: SupplierPerformance chart: bar x: project y: total_quality_score help: Periodic supplier or subcontractor scorecard. Supplier Performances added up on quality score for each project, ten largest first. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS project, ROUND(SUM(x.quality_score)::numeric, 2) AS total_quality_score FROM bus_supplier_performance x LEFT JOIN bus_project p ON p.id = x.project_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST LIMIT 10
