%%report rfi-changed-per-month title: RFIs last changed per month entity: RFI chart: line x: month y: records help: Request for information and formal response. How recently rfis were touched - a falling line is a register nobody is keeping up. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', updated_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_rfi WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND updated_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report rfi-age-bands title: How recently rfis were changed entity: RFI chart: bar x: last_changed y: records help: Request for information and formal response. Records by time since their last change; the oldest band is the stale tail to review or retire. sql: SELECT CASE WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '30 days' THEN 'last 30 days' WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '90 days' THEN '30 to 90 days' WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '180 days' THEN '90 to 180 days' ELSE 'older than 180 days' END AS last_changed, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_rfi WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY MIN(updated_at) DESC
%%report rfi-due-date-per-month title: RFIs by due date entity: RFI chart: line x: month y: records help: Request for information and formal response. RFIs grouped by the month of due date, looking two years back and one ahead. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', due_date), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_rfi WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND due_date IS NOT NULL AND due_date >= now() - interval '24 months' AND due_date < now() + interval '12 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report rfi-completeness title: How complete rfis are entity: RFI chart: bar x: field y: missing help: Request for information and formal response. For each optional field, how many rfis leave it empty; the long bars are the fields nobody fills in. sql: SELECT 'raised by account' AS field, COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE raised_by_account_id IS NULL) AS missing FROM bus_rfi WHERE deleted_at IS NULL UNION ALL SELECT 'assigned to account', COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE assigned_to_account_id IS NULL) FROM bus_rfi WHERE deleted_at IS NULL UNION ALL SELECT 'due date', COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE due_date IS NULL) FROM bus_rfi WHERE deleted_at IS NULL UNION ALL SELECT 'response', COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE response IS NULL) FROM bus_rfi WHERE deleted_at IS NULL UNION ALL SELECT 'cost impact', COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE cost_impact IS NULL) FROM bus_rfi WHERE deleted_at IS NULL UNION ALL SELECT 'schedule impact', COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE schedule_impact IS NULL) FROM bus_rfi WHERE deleted_at IS NULL ORDER BY 2 DESC
