%%report handover-package-completeness-percent-by-status title: Total completeness percent by status entity: HandoverPackage chart: bar x: status y: total_completeness_percent help: Structured turnover package of documents, tests and training. Handover Packages added up on completeness percent, split by status, to show where the quantity sits. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, ROUND(SUM(completeness_percent)::numeric, 2) AS total_completeness_percent FROM bus_handover_package WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST
%%report handover-package-completeness-percent-per-month title: Average completeness percent per month entity: HandoverPackage chart: line x: month y: average_completeness_percent help: Structured turnover package of documents, tests and training. The average completeness percent of handover packages created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(completeness_percent)::numeric, 2) AS average_completeness_percent FROM bus_handover_package WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report handover-package-largest-by-completeness-percent title: The ten largest handover packages by completeness percent entity: HandoverPackage chart: bar x: record y: completeness_percent help: Structured turnover package of documents, tests and training. The records with the highest completeness percent; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT package_type::text AS record, completeness_percent FROM bus_handover_package WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND completeness_percent IS NOT NULL ORDER BY completeness_percent DESC LIMIT 10
