%%report bank-account-by-status title: Bank Accounts by status entity: BankAccount chart: pie x: status y: records help: Legal-entity bank account used for receipts and payments. How bank accounts divide across status, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_bank_account WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report bank-account-lifecycle title: Bank Account lifecycle entity: BankAccount chart: bar x: state y: records help: Legal-entity bank account used for receipts and payments. Where bank accounts sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'draft' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'active', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'cancelled', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'closed', 3) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_bank_account WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
