%%report customer-credit-limit-per-month title: Average credit limit per month entity: Customer chart: line x: month y: average_credit_limit help: Bill-to and sold-to customer account. The average credit limit of customers created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(credit_limit)::numeric, 2) AS average_credit_limit FROM bus_customer WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report customer-largest-by-credit-limit title: The ten largest customers by credit limit entity: Customer chart: bar x: record y: credit_limit help: Bill-to and sold-to customer account. The records with the highest credit limit; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT customer_number::text AS record, credit_limit FROM bus_customer WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND credit_limit IS NOT NULL ORDER BY credit_limit DESC LIMIT 10
