%%report customer-contract-original-value-by-status title: Total original value by status (Customer Contract) entity: CustomerContract chart: bar x: status y: total_original_value help: Billable client contract and revenue terms. Customer Contracts added up on original value, split by status, to show where the quantity sits. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, ROUND(SUM(original_value)::numeric, 2) AS total_original_value FROM bus_customer_contract WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST
