%%report customer-invoice-lifecycle title: Customer Invoice lifecycle entity: CustomerInvoice chart: bar x: state y: records help: Accounts receivable progress invoice, milestone invoice or credit memo. Where customer invoices sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'draft' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'active', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'cancelled', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'closed', 3) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_customer_invoice WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
