%%report customer-invoice-line-largest-by-unit-price title: The ten largest customer invoice lines by unit price entity: CustomerInvoiceLine chart: bar x: record y: unit_price help: Billable line mapped to SOV, project, revenue and tax. The records with the highest unit price; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT tax_code::text AS record, unit_price FROM bus_customer_invoice_line WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND unit_price IS NOT NULL ORDER BY unit_price DESC LIMIT 10
