%%report customer-receipt-by-status title: Customer Receipts by status entity: CustomerReceipt chart: pie x: status y: records help: Cash receipt and invoice application. How customer receipts divide across status, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_customer_receipt WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report customer-receipt-lifecycle title: Customer Receipt lifecycle entity: CustomerReceipt chart: bar x: state y: records help: Cash receipt and invoice application. Where customer receipts sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'draft' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'active', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'cancelled', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'closed', 3) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_customer_receipt WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
%%report customer-receipt-amount-by-status title: Total amount by status entity: CustomerReceipt chart: bar x: status y: total_amount help: Cash receipt and invoice application. Customer Receipts added up on amount, split by status, to show where the quantity sits. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, ROUND(SUM(amount)::numeric, 2) AS total_amount FROM bus_customer_receipt WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST
