%%report close-task-due-date-per-month title: Close Tasks by due date entity: CloseTask chart: line x: month y: records help: Period-end close activity and evidence. Close Tasks grouped by the month of due date, looking two years back and one ahead. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', due_date), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_close_task WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND due_date IS NOT NULL AND due_date >= now() - interval '24 months' AND due_date < now() + interval '12 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report close-task-completeness title: How complete close tasks are entity: CloseTask chart: bar x: field y: missing help: Period-end close activity and evidence. For each optional field, how many close tasks leave it empty; the long bars are the fields nobody fills in. sql: SELECT 'dependency task' AS field, COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE dependency_task_id IS NULL) AS missing FROM bus_close_task WHERE deleted_at IS NULL UNION ALL SELECT 'evidence document', COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE evidence_document_id IS NULL) FROM bus_close_task WHERE deleted_at IS NULL ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report approver-created-per-month title: Approvers created per month entity: Approver chart: line x: month y: records help: Controlled reference used by construction and ERP transactions that point to Approver. New approvers per month over two years - the volume the business actually handles. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_approver WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report approver-age-bands title: How recently approvers were changed entity: Approver chart: bar x: last_changed y: records help: Controlled reference used by construction and ERP transactions that point to Approver. Records by time since their last change; the oldest band is the stale tail to review or retire. sql: SELECT CASE WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '30 days' THEN 'last 30 days' WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '90 days' THEN '30 to 90 days' WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '180 days' THEN '90 to 180 days' ELSE 'older than 180 days' END AS last_changed, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_approver WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY MIN(updated_at) DESC
%%report approver-active-share title: Approvers: active entity: Approver chart: pie x: active y: records help: Controlled reference used by construction and ERP transactions that point to Approver. The share of approvers where active holds against those where it does not. sql: SELECT CASE WHEN active THEN 'yes' ELSE 'no' END AS active, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_approver WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
