%%report evidence-document-active-share title: Evidence Documents: active entity: EvidenceDocument chart: pie x: active y: records help: Controlled reference used by construction and ERP transactions that point to EvidenceDocument. The share of evidence documents where active holds against those where it does not. sql: SELECT CASE WHEN active THEN 'yes' ELSE 'no' END AS active, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_evidence_document WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
