%%report to-warehouse-active-share title: To Warehouses: active entity: ToWarehouse chart: pie x: active y: records help: Controlled reference used by construction and ERP transactions that point to ToWarehouse. The share of to warehouses where active holds against those where it does not. sql: SELECT CASE WHEN active THEN 'yes' ELSE 'no' END AS active, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_to_warehouse WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
